read me your best cell number, digits only?\nUser: Sure thing, it's 7135551234. Thanks for setting this up — looking forward to solving this missed call chaos!\nAgent: One moment while I confirm that for you.\nAgent: Thanks, Sofia! You're all set for tomorrow at 10:45am Central with Jay. You'll receive a text confirmation at 713‑555‑1234 in a moment — you can add it to your calendar in one click or reschedule if you need to.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with?\n\nReally glad you called. Jay's looking forward to it. Have a great day! Bye!",
